<title>USA: Haverfield retains investment bankers.</title>
<headline>Haverfield retains investment bankers.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haverfield Corp said it has retained Charles Webb &amp; Co to render investment banking advice to the board of directors of the company with respect to enhancement of shareholder value.</p>
<p>Haverfield said Charles Webb &amp; Co will assist in formulating a business plan and advice regarding possible strategic affiliation with other entities.</p>
<p>Although the company has been in discussion from time to time with various interested parties regarding possible strategic alliance transactions, no specific transaction has been entered into, Haverfield said.</p>
</text>
